# Libs/ are committed for dev-build testing (the packager MERGES .pkgmeta
# externals on top at release — it never removes the committed copies first,
# so keep them a subset of upstream).

# Generated by the release workflow (or a local packager rehearsal) — never
# committed; the workflow regenerates and silently overwrites them each run.
RELEASE_NOTES.md
RELEASE_NOTES.html
.release/

# Nested private dev repo (tracker, plans) — never packaged or pushed with
# the public addon (same pattern as Homestead's Home_Dev).
HNH_Dev/

# Local review-gate marker, machine state, never committed.
.claude/review-pass.json

# Local agent instructions.
/AGENTS.md
